{{!-- What the character came away with. Posted when the Scar is taken, and again when a gain
      roll that was waiting on the fiction is finally made — the table hears the second one too,
      because it is the one that moves a number. --}}
<p><strong>{{name}}</strong> {{text}}</p>
{{#if outcome}}
<p class="cairn-card-outcome success">{{outcome}}</p>
{{else if pending}}
<p>{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.Deferred'}}</p>
{{else}}
<p>{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.NoChange'}}</p>
{{/if}}
